  "description": "INISEF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H134 Dy4 Mn4 N32 O28 6+,6(N1 O3 1-),12(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Mn1 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Mn2 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn3 (Mn) has 5 O neighbors; Mn4 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.280-4.570 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.25-148.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C128H158Dy4Mn4N38O58. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
